Package: iris-mail-stack
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, curl, openssl, ca-certificates
Maintainer: Meow Labs <admin@meowlabs.id>
Homepage: https://github.com/Urdemonlord/irisproject
Description: IRIS webmail and Stalwart mail server in one package
 One .deb installs the whole self-hosted mail stack: the IRIS webmail
 API and web app, the Stalwart mail server (SMTP, IMAP, JMAP), and a
 Caddy reverse proxy with automatic TLS. The installer asks for one
 domain, generates all secrets, and provisions the mail server, so a
 fresh server goes from empty to working webmail in one step.
 .
 IRIS is a single 13 MB binary with no containers and no cloud account.
 Stalwart is a single static binary. Both are pinned in versions.env.
